## 4. Planned technology

| Area | Choice | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Runtime | Python 3.12, isolated environment | CPU-only local development |
| Data | pandas, DuckDB SQL, Parquet | Cleaning, aggregation and repeatable data checks |
| Forecasts | Simple rules, statsmodels ARIMA, LightGBM | Baselines and a pooled direct forecasting model |
| Optimisation | PuLP with a verified CBC solver | Whole-unit reorder decisions under constraints |
| Experiment tracking | Local MLflow | Parameters, metrics and artifact provenance |
| Delivery | CLI, FastAPI, Docker | Repeatable batch runs and local serving |
| Quality | pytest, Ruff, GitHub Actions | Scientific and engineering checks |
| Reporting | Matplotlib and Markdown | Forecast plots, scenario comparisons and model card |

Exact dependency versions will be resolved and locked in T01. None of these dependencies have been installed by this planning task.

