## 6. Important interpretation

- Forecasts estimate recorded sales as a proxy for demand; unobserved demand cannot be recovered from this dataset.
- Inventory, procurement costs, budgets and lead times are scenario inputs. They are not observed facts about the retailer.
- Performance targets are hypotheses. Results and business improvements are **not measured yet**.
- The Malaysian employer mapping comes from the supplied workbook. This task did not verify whether those vacancies remain open.
- Public hosting and a dashboard are later options. The first release is a local, reproducible demonstrator.

